  "description": "Three fire-rating stories are recorded under the literal comparison: story-1 (\"90 min\" against \"1.5 h\"), story-2 (\"60 min\" against \"1.5 h\", then \"90 min\" on Wednesday) and story-3 (\"90 min\" against \"1.5 h\", ended on Thursday when A-601 withdraws its value). A normalization of the project naming the fixture fire-rating interpretation, effective Tuesday 10:00, is recorded last, and maintenance answers it in the same operation. Story-1 was open on Tuesday and its sides match: a new end act, cause normalization, citing the normalization, at Tuesday 10:00; its begin act is unchanged. Story-2 still differed on Tuesday and so continues; Wednesday's \"90 min\" now aligns it: a new end act, cause alignment, citing the Wednesday Assertion and matched_by the normalization. Story-3's Thursday withdrawal ending is revised to Tuesday's normalization ending. Monday frames are unchanged; what remains at Tuesday noon lists story-2 under the fire-rating interpretation.",
